      "value": "Tiny yellow to orange horns, 2–12 mm tall (up to 2 cm), rarely forked.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "Greasy and rubbery, like stiff jelly.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "value": "In small groups on dead broadleaved wood.",
      "sources": [
        "fn",
        "wp"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "habitat": {
